BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:summer-school-2026@netsec-cost.eu
DTSTAMP:20260522T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Stockholm:20260609T090000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Stockholm:20260611T180000
SUMMARY:NetSec Early-Career Scholars Summer School
DESCRIPTION:Three days of training and mentoring for early-career researchers in European security — research presentations\, individualised feedback from senior scholars\, and structured mentorship. Open to PhD candidates and post-docs (within one year of defence) in strategic studies and international security\, as well as SWAMOS / Euro-SWAMOS alumni.\n\nScientific Coordinators: Dr Silvia D'Amato\, Prof Chiara Ruffa.\n\nFull details: https://eiss-europa.com/NetSecSchool.html
LOCATION:Stockholm University\, Frescativägen 114 18\, Sweden
URL;VALUE=URI:https://eiss-europa.com/NetSecSchool.html
ORGANIZER;CN=NetSec Summer School:mailto:ecs.netsec@eiss-europa.com
CATEGORIES:Training School,NetSec
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:european-security-conference-2026@netsec-cost.eu
DTSTAMP:20260522T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Stockholm:20260611T080000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Stockholm:20260612T200000
SUMMARY:European Security Conference 2026
DESCRIPTION:The flagship annual gathering of the NetSec community: an interdisciplinary conference on European defence and security open to academics\, policy-makers\, and practitioners. Held back-to-back with the Summer School so early-career scholars can join the wider conversation.\n\nChairpersons: Dr Julia Carver\, Dr Sanne Verschuren.\n\nProgramme and registration: https://indico.eiss-europa.com/event/22/
LOCATION:Stockholm University\, Frescativägen\, 114 19 Stockholm\, Sweden
URL;VALUE=URI:https://indico.eiss-europa.com/event/22/
CATEGORIES:Annual Conference,NetSec
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
